  "discordPostHtml": "<p>Ever feel like your Luddic faithful are just too picky? Worlds that are harsh, polluted, or missing a few farms shouldn’t ruin a colony’s harmony?</p><p>This mod lets your Luddic populations tolerate things they normally wouldn’t:</p><p>Harsh or uninhabitable worlds? They’ll make do.</p><p>Dardan Kato’s policies trying to suppress them? Not a problem anymore.</p><p>Pick what the faithful will tolerate. Keep it subtle, or disable the Heavy Industry factor entirely if you want them to ignore all industrial hubs.</p><p>Thanks to LunaLib integration, you can tweak which negating factors are enforced - or turn them all off if you want the faithful to just… get along with everything.</p><p>Your colonies, your rules, your Luddic faithful thriving despite all the things that normally wouldn’t fly.</p><p>DOWNLOAD: <a href=\"https://github.com/exon-farer/Tolerant.LuddicMajority/releases/latest/download/Tolerant.LuddicMajority.zip\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/exon-farer/Tolerant.LuddicMajority/releases/latest/download/Tolerant.LuddicMajority.zip</a></p>",
